				},
				{
					"id": 400250347,
					"content": "说得也是。不过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250348
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250348,
					"content": "唉，这就是棘手的部分了。我有些担心自己会堆不好雪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250353,
					"content": "我从没亲手堆过雪人。家里管教很严，小时候并没有这种机会。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250354
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250354,
					"content": "长大之后，就更不可能做这样的事情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250355
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250355,
					"content": "怎么办，我已经开始觉得优菈很可怜了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250356,
						400250357
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250356,
					"content": "放轻松，是玩而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250358
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250358,
					"content": "…你可真是自信啊，好吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250359
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250359,
					"content": "那么，闲聊就暂时告一段落吧，我看到有冒险家协会的成员过来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250360
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250360,
					"content": "二位，现在的情况有些麻烦。我们盘点下来，发现报名人员是单数，就是说，只剩下最后一个教官名额了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250361
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250361,
					"content": "至于人手不足这件事，其实是这样的，原本我们还请了菲谢尔来当教官，但她有事不在城内，只好让另一位冒险家代打。不过，那位也迟迟没有出现…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250362
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250362,
					"content": "幸好有你们帮忙。唉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250363
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250363,
					"content": "两位好，我叫杰拉德，是个新人冒险家…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250364
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰拉德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250364,
					"content": "那就…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250365
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250365,
					"content": "那就让优菈去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250366
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250366,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250367
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250367,
					"content": "行，这个仇我记下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250368
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250368,
					"content": "欸？记仇？…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250369,
						400250370
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰拉德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250369,
					"content": "优菈的说话风格是这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250371
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250371,
					"content": "我、我明白了。我一定会好好跟着学习！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250372
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰拉德"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250372,
					"content": "好，好，那就这么安排了，多谢优菈小姐帮忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250373
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250373,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，如果之后还有成员报名，到时候我再来麻烦你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250374
					],
					"speakerTitle": "塞琉斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250374,
					"content": "没问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250375
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250375,
					"content": "刚才你为什么要把名额留给优菈呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250376,
						400250377
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250376,
					"content": "希望大家知道更多她的优点。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250378
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250378,
					"content": "原来是这样，嘿嘿，你人真不错！优菈刚刚还笑了，应该是理解你的心意了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250379
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250379,
					"content": "仔细想想，一般人很难在雪山这种严寒环境中行动，优菈确实是最适合当教官的人选了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250380
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250380,
					"content": "哦！我明白了，安柏应该也是这么想的，所以才推荐她来参加这个活动！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250381
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250381,
					"content": "说是要找素材，现在优菈都去忙了，我也不太想到处跑来跑去搜集东西…不知道安柏他们进度如何了，我们上山看看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250377,
					"content": "优菈缺少这样的机会。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250378
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250370,
					"content": "优菈的能力绝对值得信任…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250371
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250357,
					"content": "别担心，荣誉骑士帮你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250358
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250349,
					"content": "但优菈似乎还有其他困扰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250350
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250350,
					"content": "哼，很敏锐嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250351
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250351,
					"content": "大家聊天的时候，难道你一直盯着我的表情吗？这仇我记下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250352
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250352,
					"content": "坦白说，我有些担心自己会堆不好雪人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250353
					],
					"speakerTitle": "优菈"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250339,
					"content": "这里只有我们，你就说吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250340
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250336,
					"content": "我在想优菈在想什么…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250337
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250303,
					"content": "好久不见了，乔尔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250304
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4002504,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4002507
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4002507",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4002507,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿贝多"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400250401,
					"content": "到这里为止，声音完全消失了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250402,
					"content": "看来是跟丢了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250403,
					"content": "可我们的跟踪技术不是已经在那么多次旅行中练得炉火纯青了吗？居然还会跟丢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250404,
					"content": "要不然，就是对方比我们想的还厉害，那他得是什么人呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250405,
					"content": "这个声音是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250406,
					"content": "嗯？欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250407,
					"content": "怎么有空到雪山来？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250408,
					"content": "原来是你啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250409
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250409,
					"content": "哦！原来是阿贝多啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250410,
					"content": "「原来」？你指的是…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250411,
					"content": "刚才我们一路走来，总能感觉到视线和声音，像是周围有人一样…没想到，居然是你在这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250412,
					"content": "那种气氛，害得我都紧张起来了，真是的，没事不要装神弄鬼啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250413,
					"content": "雪山上的视线和声音也有可能来自动物或盗贼。在这里最好保持警惕，否则或许会遭受各种意想不到的损失。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250414,
					"content": "两位来雪山有什么事吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250415,
					"content": "说来话长…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250416
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250416,
					"content": "其实我们一开始是想来找你，后来又决定要找安柏，结果又先遇上了你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250417,
					"content": "嗯，思维和语言表达都相当混乱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250418,
					"content": "你、你这家伙！我是说！我们就是来找你的啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250419,
					"content": "哦？是吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250420,
					"content": "那一定是有重要的事了，我洗耳恭听。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250421,
					"content": "其实…也没有…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250422
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250422,
					"content": "总觉得他心情还不错？难道他并没有介意蒂玛乌斯太笨的事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250423,
					"content": "不会是我们多心了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250424
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250424,
					"content": "呃啊…装、装作不知道好了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250425,
					"content": "不方便说也没关系，就当是来雪山散散步，看看风景。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250426,
					"content": "啊哈哈，那就直接说重点吧…其实，我们是在履行身为冒险家的职责哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250427,
					"content": "将冒险家协会举办活动一事告知阿贝多…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250428
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250428,
					"content": "原来如此，你们把那位新人交给优菈，自己跑出来偷懒了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250429,
					"content": "怎么能叫偷懒呢，我们这是谦让哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250430,
					"content": "倒是你，今天来雪山做什么呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250431,
					"content": "最近有些朋友委托的稿子还没画完，我来僻静之地找找灵感，顺便搜集些原材料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250432,
					"content": "什么的原材料？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250433,
					"content": "颜料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250434,
					"content": "星银矿能用于制作高级银色颜料，我自制的银色颜料刚巧用完了，过来采点矿石。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250435,
					"content": "原来矿石还能做颜料呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250436,
					"content": "嗯。不过，开采时要注意区分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250437,
					"content": "有些杂质含量高的星银矿乍看也含有银色细颗粒，但光泽较差，制成颜料显色度也低，这种一般会被归为赝品或次品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250438,
					"content": "嗯嗯，那除了颜料，能不能再分享一些找灵感的方法？我也想学！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250439,
					"content": "你也想画画？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250440,
					"content": "#不不，我自己就不用了，是想让{NICKNAME}这家伙学学啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250441,
					"content": "我们到处旅行，偶尔也会遇上无事可做的夜晚。有时闲着，就想做点有纪念意义的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250442,
					"content": "画画是件好事啊，可以留住瞬间，所以我认为，学画画一定不亏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250443
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250443,
					"content": "也就是要我学的意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250444
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250444,
					"content": "对啊，你学一学怎么了嘛！学会了就能画我啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250445
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250445,
					"content": "想法不错。既然两位想多了解关于绘画的事，不妨跟我到营地去，那里有画材，可以边讲解边练习。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250446
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿贝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250446,
					"content": "好呀好呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250447,
					"content": "那安柏…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250448
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250448,
					"content": "安柏可是堂堂西风骑士，一定没问题的，我们就不要管那些事啦，先去阿贝多那边吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250449
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400250449,
					"content": "好吧好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400250450
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400250450,
					"content": "走吧，外面这么冷，我想快点到营地去烤火！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
